   DataFusion Physical Plan: 
     : AggregateExec: mode=Single, gby=[], aggr=[pdb_string_agg(a_0.name, a_0.sep) as agg_0]
     :   HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Inner, on=[(id@2, a_id@0)], projection=[name@0, sep@1]
     :     CooperativeExec
     :       PgSearchScan: table=a, segments=1, eager=[name, sep], visibility=eager, query={"boolean":{"must":[{"with_index":{"query":{"all":{"field":"id"}}}},{"term":{"field":"grp","value":2}}]}}
     :     CooperativeExec
     :       PgSearchScan: table=b, segments=1, dynamic_filters=1, visibility=eager, query="all"
